# Local Python virtual environments. Nothing here is Python, but the repo is
# only Backend/ and Frontend/, so a venv made while working has nowhere else to
# land — and a venv is ~22MB of machine-specific binaries that must never be
# committed. Backend/.gitignore carries the same rule.
